# One profile per line: profile_name|cookie_header
# The profile name becomes accounts/<profile_name> and is used by the pool.
# How to obtain: log into https://www.dola.com -> F12 -> Network -> request -> Headers -> Cookie
# Lines starting with # are comments. Replace the placeholder values with real cookies.
# Required cookie: sessionid
# Optional but recommended when available: msToken, s_v_web_id
# Example:
# acc1|msToken=xxxx; s_v_web_id=ver_xxxx; sessionid=xxxx; passport_auth_status=xxxx; sid_guard=xxxx
